{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"title":1,"excerpt":2,"tags":3,"film":5},"Toni, en famille (Toni)","Antonia, dite Toni, élève seule ses cinq enfants. Un job à plein-temps. Elle chante aussi le soir, dans des bars, car il faut bien nourrir sa famille. Toni a du talent. Elle a enregistré un single qui a cartonné. Mais ça, c’était il y a 20 ans. Aujourd’hui ses deux aînés s’apprêtent à rejoindre l’université. Alors Toni s’interroge : que fera-t-elle quand toute sa progéniture aura quitté le foyer ? A 43 ans, est-il encore temps de reprendre sa vie en main ?",[4],"motherhood",{"type":6,"id":7,"slug":8,"title":9,"release":12,"filmType":16,"directors":17,"genre":26,"media":29,"synopsis":32,"production":34,"characters":37,"roles":38,"awards":57,"tags":3},"Film","FR2023_157","fr2023-157-toni-en-famille",{"native":10,"english":11},"Toni, en famille","Toni",{"type":13,"date":14,"year":15},"Theatrical release","2023-09-06",2023,"Fiction film",[18],{"id":19,"slug":20,"name":19,"birthYear":21,"deathYear":22,"gender":23,"nationality":24,"awards":25},"Nathan Ambrosioni","nathan-ambrosioni",1999,0,"Male identifying","France",[],[27,28],"Comedy","Drama",{"posterUrl":30,"trailerUrl":31},"https://medias.unifrance.org/medias/220/16/266460/format_page/toni-en-famille.jpg","https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ezVqVGFzexk",{"native":2,"english":33},"",[35],{"country":24,"share":36},"Majority coproducer",[],[39,47,51],{"person":40,"role":46},{"id":41,"slug":42,"name":41,"birthYear":43,"deathYear":22,"gender":44,"nationality":24,"awards":45},"Catherine Mouchet","catherine-mouchet",1959,"Female identifying",[],"Minor actor/Cameo",{"person":48,"role":50},{"id":19,"slug":20,"name":19,"birthYear":21,"deathYear":22,"gender":23,"nationality":24,"awards":49},[],"Director of the film",{"person":52,"role":46},{"id":53,"slug":54,"name":53,"birthYear":55,"deathYear":22,"gender":44,"nationality":24,"awards":56},"Saadia Bentaïeb","saadia-bentaieb",1956,[],[]],"uses":{"params":["slug"]}}